mode in R returns the objects type. To get the statistical mode with base R you need to write a function for mode

stat_mode &lt;- function(x){
  tab &lt;- table(x)
  mode_cha &lt;- names(tab)[tab == max(tab)]# annoying it returns a character 
  mode &lt;- as.numeric(mode_cha)
  return(mode)
}
